  description: "1 Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters\nIf this card is Synchro Summoned
    using a \"Blackwing\" monster as Material, it is treated as a Tuner while face-up
    on the field. You can only use each of these effects of \"Assault Blackwing -
    Sohaya the Rain Storm\" once per turn. \u25CF When this card is Synchro Summoned:
    You can target 1 \"Assault Blackwing\" monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon
    it. \u25CF During your Main Phase, if this card is in the Graveyard because it
    was sent there this turn: You can banish 1 other \"Assault Blackwing - Sohaya
    the Rain Storm\" from your Graveyard; Special Summon this card."
